  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a24ac998-cb5b-430d-ac09-beff6aa351a8"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the smallest regular map of type {",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 "}, as a graph: ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 "-gon faces, ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " of them at every vertex.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"2fa45789-eb60-47d3-b2e4-f4314011aa93"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["TessellationGraph"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/TessellationGraph", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["q", "TI"]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "496d34f5-021e-4a23-8590-dbf048651629"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-th map of that type in increasing order of size: the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " \[Times] ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 " flat torus when the type is Euclidean, the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-th quotient of the triangle group otherwise.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"455d7bd1-802c-4834-b59b-466ba354c753"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["TessellationGraph"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/TessellationGraph", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["q", "TI"]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["m", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["n", "TI"]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f798788f-c754-4aad-9d5b-f46807b7a96f"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the ",
 StyleBox["m", "TI"],
 " \[Times] ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " flat torus of a Euclidean type.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"b56c14d8-7dbe-41f0-b2a7-8f6227d26628"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["TessellationGraph"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/TessellationGraph", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["q", "TI"]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "G"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0f75e7a0-29ce-4f3a-8d18-3d1f2af75028"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the map carried by a (2, ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 ")-generation of the finite group ",
 StyleBox["G", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"16d2428b-64f1-4077-8583-e8d5c57d63e3"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["TessellationGraph"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/TessellationGraph", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["config", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "edf839c7-cdf7-46cb-925c-2af16df3b152"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the uniform map with vertex configuration ",
 StyleBox["config", "TI"],
 ", the cyclic list of face sizes around a vertex, built on the ",
 StyleBox["k", "TI"],
 "-th map of its parent type."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"5f23eddd-522b-4df0-8902-98a759490550"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A regular map of type {",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 "} is a closed surface cut into ",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 "-gons, ",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " at every vertex, with a rotation taking any directed edge to any other. \
The graph is its 1-skeleton. The faces are not returned."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7f8076e0-b0aa-44f7-8a48-54339ff3ba67"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The sign of (",
 StyleBox["p", "TI"],
 " \[Minus] 2)(",
 StyleBox["q", "TI"],
 " \[Minus] 2) \[Minus] 4 is the sign of the curvature. It decides the \
surface:"
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"ccbc2e7b-e384-4f48-bd4b-6be4fa417420"],

