Cell["\<\
The first three {3, 7} maps, of the groups of order 168, 504 and 1092: their \
vertices and their genus 1 \[Minus] \[Chi]/2.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"72aca1ab-6135-4b17-a25b-f2f29c118b08"],

